    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Thorn and the shallows, which on Wracklow is the whole economy. Bramble grows in all eight of this landmass's regions and nowhere else in the world; here it is 37 per cent of the ground, cut for burning because nothing else on the island will burn. The rest is meadow and reef, and the lagoon inside the reef is calm enough to work at any state of tide."
  },
